  "content": "<blockquote>\n  <h1>混沌降生：被遗忘的内容</h1>\n  <h3>混沌降生的附属模组，重新实现了部分已移除的特性</h3>\n  <p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c0694451835129e1ad9106a632aa557e77e8f23f.png\" alt=\"模组所有特性一览，含模组标题\"></p>\n</blockquote><h3>加入我们的Discord以获取模组更新、预告片等最新资讯！（点击）</h3><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/mEYDh4SUWN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9cea9cd7dc8511b56c21d5eef30b040a9f9f81d2.png\" alt=\"Discord横幅图片\"></a></p><p><strong>需要GeckoLib和混沌降生模组！</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/197e417b0e192c49a53b39d7ad40764848f6959a.png\" alt=\"GeckoLib徽标\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/born-in-chaos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/47e8a24f21aae1844cafbad4e09cd3c09c66f61f.png\" alt=\"混沌降生徽标\"></a></p><p>（请在<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/born-in-chaos-forgotten-content/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">问题追踪器</a>或Discord服务器报告漏洞）</p><p><strong>免责声明：本模组中的概念最初由Mongoose_Artist创作。其模组主页可在此处找到：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mongoose_artist/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击前往</a></strong></p><blockquote>\n  <h3>生物</h3>\n</blockquote><h4>凋零爬虫</h4><p>一种小型蜘蛛，能使目标受到凋零效果。拥有15点生命值，有极小概率掉落凋零玫瑰</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a88c57a43c63a6bc14b1a6fc4921bbe17b764820.png\" alt=\"几只凋零爬虫在蛛网间\"></p><h4>羞涩之灵</h4><p>一种攻击力极低的幽灵，但受到攻击时会使玩家失明并减速，随后消失。可使用玻璃瓶将其装瓶获得瓶中灵</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/052b56628d5120ae391e0684010cec26a5f0590a.png\" alt=\"夜间的几只羞涩之灵\"></p><blockquote>\n  <h3>物品</h3>\n</blockquote><h4>瓶中灵</h4><p>通过用玻璃瓶点击羞涩之灵获得，食用后可获得速度和夜视效果。同时也是制作神秘棒棒糖的必需材料</p><h4>神秘棒棒糖</h4><p>由一根木棍、三个瓶中灵、两个糖和一个混沌种子制成，可无限食用但存在冷却时间</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d0f61d03603c13ec778598e9cbb4401e82da3693.png\" alt=\"神秘棒棒糖和瓶中灵分别在物品展示框中\"></p><h3>欢迎查看我的其他模组！</h3><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fextra-advancements\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a999856e189e9910f71f97b6752a9cb969b1dde6.png\" alt=\"额外进度徽标\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fring-of-flight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c112eee024035b195d5a234272abba6c598494e7.png\" alt=\"飞行之戒徽标\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreatures-expanded\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8f6fda41186241f719ef6bd4351817279346ec77.png\" alt=\"生物扩展徽标\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frunestones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/744f4e38045fd76f9d405b210cede837e7b9e15e.png\" alt=\"符文石徽标\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fwolfys-extra-expansion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/88ecc3da1b7a721f6fe7093bc3b6c3a087f92427.png\" alt=\"狼崽的额外扩展徽标\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcharms-and-medallions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7413da591bdcad32d93163a09954b6384824d5d1.png\" alt=\"护符与勋章徽标\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fskeleton-uprising\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/43c403e8067c5c6f6ee1306984c8719e187453f8.png\" alt=\"骷髅起义徽标\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbasic-loot-bags\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a03ec805abf083b22228752ead56a9b264825069.png\" alt=\"基础战利品袋徽标\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fadditions-and-more\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/891a1f575f6e7ec2199e788d671f37560df1a383.png\" alt=\"更多添加徽标\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252farcanic-armaments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7dced5fde95557814ccf077dc90058438274e31b.png\" alt=\"奥秘武装徽标\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmob-charms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a3982d5805a631af3439982b2a68dceeacf2f17e.png\" alt=\"生物护符徽标\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdensity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/beb6e83aa5978a5f309bece423271111d7d07aa8.png\" alt=\"密度徽标\"></a></p>",
